_vpp_build/test_figs/
_vpp_build/trial_figs/

# DPDK 构建区：同样只提交内容源、脚本与构建报告
_dpdk_build/*.svg
_dpdk_build/*.pdf
_dpdk_build/*.docx
_dpdk_build/audit_report.json
_dpdk_build/audit_dpdk.txt
_dpdk_build/build_final.log
_dpdk_build/check_*.svg

# OpenVPN 构建区：同样只提交内容源、脚本与构建报告
